      ledger(s, "The Town opened the bank with two clerks from Records. The first customer withdrew everything and bought a hat.", [], 2);
      paper(s, "Town Reopens Bank With Records Staff; First Withdrawal Spent on Hat", "The bank reopened yesterday under municipal management with two clerks from the Records Department behind the counter. The first customer withdrew a full balance in cash and crossed the road to the hatter. The queue applauded.", 2);
      return "Approved. Two clerks from Records. The first withdrawal was spent on a hat.";
